y Momoshiki Otsusuki, will become your master! #NTBSS','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mh2XV8Y3cnk/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mh2XV8Y3cnk/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mh2XV8Y3cnk/default.jpg','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UU_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UC_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw',4885,0,14,'2023-11-30 05:33:33.000000'),(91,'Zc-yMi05vBA','TEKKEN 8 - Steve Fox Reveal & Gameplay Trailer','Time to knock out the competition🥊\nSteve will beat everyone to the punch in #TEKKEN8!\n\nFollow Bandai Namco Entertainment: \nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/bandainamcous\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/BandaiNamcoUS\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/BandaiNamcoUS\nTwitch: http://www.twitch.tv/bandainamcous','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Zc-yMi05vBA/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Zc-yMi05vBA/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Zc-yMi05vBA/default.jpg','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UU_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UC_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw',952736,0,4442,'2023-11-29 14:00:33.000000'),(92,'P9I10yR9OXQ','DRAGONBALL FIGHTERZ Dramatic Finish Gogeta (SSGSS) VS Broly #DBFZ #DBFZWT2023 #Shorts','The Dragon Ball FighterZ World Tour is underway.\n\nWatch the playlist: http://spr.ly/6001uxNRd\n\nCatch the latest updates: https://twitter.com/BNEesports','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/P9I10yR9OXQ/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/P9I10yR9OXQ/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/P9I10yR9OXQ/default.jpg','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UU_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UC_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw',6046,0,30,'2023-11-28 16:00:20.000000'),(93,'mJlMzcsWyxA','MY HERO ULTRA RUMBLE — Season 2 Trailer','Things are heating up in Season 2 of MY HERO ULTRA RUMBLE — the superpowered FREE-TO-PLAY battle royale! Season 2 is live now!\n\nBrand new content coming in Season 2:\n💥 Flame Hero: Endeavor joins the battle! The No. 2 hero delivers burning justice with his Quirk “Hellflame”!\n💥 Duo up in the new 2-Player Team Battle mode! 12 teams of 2 duke it out for doubles supremacy!\n💥 New costumes to collect!\n\nPlay for FREE today on PlayStation, Xbox, Steam, and Nintendo Switch: www.playmyheroultrarumble.com \n\n#MYHEROULTRARUMBLE #MHUR\nFollow MY HERO ULTRA RUMBLE:\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/myherour/\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/MyHeroUR\n\nFollow Bandai Namco Entertainment America:\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/bandainamcous\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/BandaiNamcoUS\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/BandaiNamcoUS\nTwitch: http://www.twitch.tv/bandainamcous','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mJlMzcsWyxA/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mJlMzcsWyxA/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mJlMzcsWyxA/default.jpg','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UU_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UC_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw',23197,0,119,'2023-11-25 15:00:38.000000'),(94,'e1N4juHVqNc','Jujutsu Kaisen Cursed Clash - Character Trailer #4','Kento Nanami, Mahito, as well as Eso & Kechizu are ready to take on the competition! \nJujutsu Kaisen Cursed Clash releases on February 2, 2024!\n \nPre-order today: bnent.eu/JJK-CursedClash\n\n#jujutsukaisen #animegame #fightinggames','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/e1N4juHVqNc/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/e1N4juHVqNc/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/e1N4juHVqNc/default.jpg','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UU_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UC_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw',93064,0,289,'2023-11-22 15:00:27.000000'),(95,'QH6s_o3dIic','TEKKEN 8 - Leo Reveal & Gameplay Trailer','It\'s time to punch the truth out of them. Leo makes a smashing return to #TEKKEN8! \nPre-order TEKKEN 8 👉 https://tekken.com/purchase\n\nFollow Tekken:\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/tekken\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/Twitter\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/TekkenAmericas\nJoin the official TEKKEN server 👉 https://bnent.eu/TekkenDiscord','https://i.ytimg.co