outube.com/channel/UC6N0CE-p_AWTG76ynEh3zcg\n\nhttps://youtu.be/AtF-gXf6zfY','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KrTGx44a1VA/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KrTGx44a1VA/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KrTGx44a1VA/default.jpg','魚群Jyotaro','UUcQchqzJUSv5bu1IhmHqwvA','魚群Jyotaro','UCcQchqzJUSv5bu1IhmHqwvA',1362,0,0,'2023-10-22 11:25:30.000000'),(279,'0oVY9IyD2Cc','鉄拳8 第二部','切り抜き　https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6N0CE-p_AWTG76ynEh3zcg\n\nhttps://youtu.be/AtF-gXf6zfY','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0oVY9IyD2Cc/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0oVY9IyD2Cc/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0oVY9IyD2Cc/default.jpg','魚群Jyotaro','UUcQchqzJUSv5bu1IhmHqwvA','魚群Jyotaro','UCcQchqzJUSv5bu1IhmHqwvA',63,0,0,'2023-10-22 11:22:56.000000'),(280,'q4IJGfPGAtc','New Character AZUCENA First Ranked Battle Footage!','Please Subscribe For More TEKKEN High Level Content!\n\nWatch on Twitch: https://www.twitch.tv/tk_anakin\nTwitter: https://www.twitter.com/tk_anakin\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/tk_anakin\n\nThe TEKKEN 8 Closed Beta Test kicks off this weekend - With it comes new playable characters led by TEKKEN newcome Azucena. She\'s very interesting, and of course any new character will be fun to use. These are some highlights from the first few hours of using Azucena in TEKKEN 8. Enjoy!','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/q4IJGfPGAtc/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/q4IJGfPGAtc/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/q4IJGfPGAtc/default.jpg','Anakin','UU86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA','Anakin','UC86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA',22720,0,116,'2023-10-20 12:56:10.000000'),(281,'ywGOigvTh7o','Even MORE High Ranked Matches from the TEKKEN 8 Beta Test | Anakin Jack-8 Gameplay!','Please Subscribe For More TEKKEN High Level Content!\n\nWatch on Twitch: https://www.twitch.tv/tk_anakin\nTwitter: https://www.twitter.com/tk_anakin\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/tk_anakin\n\nSup guys, long time no see. These are the leftover Jack-8 matches from the TEKKEN 8 Closed Network Test that didn\'t make it onto any of the uploaded videos. Been holding on to these matches for a minute now haha. Looking forward to the next chance I\'ll get my hands on this game. Don\'t forget that TEKKEN 8 is releasing on January 24, 2023.. VERY soon!','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ywGOigvTh7o/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ywGOigvTh7o/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ywGOigvTh7o/default.jpg','Anakin','UU86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA','Anakin','UC86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA',6055,0,12,'2023-09-14 14:15:04.000000'),(282,'X-0hVnEvC-A','NEW TEKKEN 8 Trailer Anakin Reaction! Release Date & New Characters!','Please Subscribe For More TEKKEN High Level Content!\n\n\n\nWatch on Twitch: https://www.twitch.tv/tk_anakin\nTwitter: https://www.twitter.com/tk_anakin\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/tk_anakin\n\n\nThe latest TEKKEN 8 trailer comes with a TON of new details, including a release date! Check out my reaction & thoughts on the newest reveal at Gamescom Germany!','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/X-0hVnEvC-A/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/X-0hVnEvC-A/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/X-0hVnEvC-A/default.jpg','Anakin','UU86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA','Anakin','UC86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA',15021,0,113,'2023-08-22 22:59:05.000000'),(283,'20n31VFwVF4','The Biggest TEKKEN Tournament of All Time...','Please Subscribe For More TEKKEN High Level Content!\n\nWatch on Twitch: https://www.twitch.tv/tk_anakin\nTwitter: https://www.twitter.com/tk_anakin\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/tk_anakin\n\nGamers8 Nation\'s Cup in Saudi Arabia featured a $1 Million prize pool. It was the biggest since TWT 2019 Global Finals ($250,000). Players from around the world gathered for a chance to compete for ultimate glory and life-changing money. Team USA consisted of myself, Joey Fury & Joe Crush.  Enjoy the recap of some of our matches from the BIGGEST tournament of all time!','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/20n31VFwVF4/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/20n31VFwVF4/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/20n31VFwVF4/default.jpg','Anakin','UU86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA','Anakin','UC86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA',11148,0,38,'2023-08-22 14:00:01.000000'),(284,'Xb4VRUmwQiw','King Has UNBREAKABLE Throws in TEKKEN 8?!','Please Subscribe For More TEKKEN High Level Content!\n\nWatch on Twitch: https://www.twitch.tv/tk_anakin\nTwitter: https://www.twitter.com/tk_anakin\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/tk_anakin\n\nKing has one of the more unique features when he is in Heat System - In TEKKEN 8 he\'s able to run at the opponent and unleash an unbreakable grab which deals big damage. In heat, the run has armor. In addition to grabs replenishing his Heat gauge, King\'s heat seems like it has crazy potential... See for yourself!','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Xb4VRUmwQiw/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Xb4VRUmwQiw/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Xb4VRUmwQiw/default.jpg','Anakin','UU86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA','Anakin','UC86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA',4363,0,12,'2023-08-11 15:30:07.000000'),(285,'KIqvzXsgzlA','EVO Finalists React to New TEKKEN 8 Trailers! Anakin, Arslan Ash, Ulsan, Khan & More!','Please Subscribe For More TEKKEN High Level Content!\n\nWatch on Twitch: https://www.twitch.tv/tk_anakin\nTwitter: https://www.twitter.com/tk_anakin\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/tk_anakin\n\nBehind the scenes of the TEKKEN 8 EVO Top 8 Player\'s Room! While everyone was enjoying the new character reveals in the Mandalay Bay Arena, the top 6 finalists were in the waiting room getting ready for their matches. Here\'s an inside look of the guys\' reactions to the new Raven & Azucena trailers!','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KIqvzXsgzlA/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KIqvzXsgzlA/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KIqvzXsgzlA/default.jpg','Anakin','UU86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA','Anakin','UC86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA',175807,0,489,'2023-08-08 11:56:03.000000'),(286,'9kqRgpSApUQ','Lars is FUN again in TEKKEN 8!','Please Subscribe For More TEKKEN High Level Content!\n\nWatch on Twitch: https://www.twitch.tv/tk_anakin\nTwitter: https://www.twitter.com/tk_anakin\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/tk_anakin\n\nLars seems like one of the most re-worked characters in the TEKKEN 8 Beta. He wasn\'t the most popular tournament character in TEKKEN 7 but all that could change with the new re-work and additions to his gameplay. He comes with a new stance and with it many transitions to and from the stance and his Heat State abilities amplify the powers of the new moves. Enjoy!','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9kqRgpSApUQ/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9kqRgpSApUQ/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9kqRgpSApUQ/default.jpg','Anakin','UU86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA','Anakin','UC86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA',6610,0,35,'2023-08-05 23:30:01.000000'),(287,'gHLa3mYcFZA','I Fought a PRO PLAYER in TEKKEN 8!','Please Subscribe For More TEKKEN High Level Content!\n\nWatch on Twitch: https://www.twitch.tv/tk_anakin\nTwitter: https://www.twitter.com/tk_anakin\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/tk_anakin\n\nLaw comes equipped with nunchucks in TEKKEN 8 and it\'s about time! In this video I encounter a good friend & fellow professional player Shadow20z while tryring out Marshall Law. Shadow\'s currently one of the BEST players in North America and he appears this time rocking his Xiaoyu. Hope you guys enjoy the video & Thanks for watching!','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/gHLa3mYcFZA/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/gHLa3mYcFZA/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/gHLa3mYcFZA/default.jpg','Anakin','UU86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA','Anakin','UC86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA',9793,0,24,'2023-08-04 16:00:28.000000'),(288,'fQehvHkHkRs','CRUSHING NOOBS ON RANKED WITH XIAOYU','Please Subscribe For More TEKKEN High Level Content!\n\nWatch on Twitch: https://www.twitch.tv/tk_anakin\nTwitter: https://www.twitter.com/tk_anakin\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/tk_anakin\n\nThe name of the game in TEKKEN 8 is Aggression! That even applies to Xiaoyu, who\'s been known mostly as a defensive character during her time in the game. Being in Heat state allows for her to initiate some CRAZY offense, and I find that out during my time with her on ranked during the closed network test. Enjoy!','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fQehvHkHkRs/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fQehvHkHkRs/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fQehvHkHkRs/default.jpg','Anakin','UU86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA','Anakin','UC86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA',4286,0,12,'2023-08-02 16:00:10.000000'),(289,'bgqqdczSadM','TEKKEN 8 Heat System Showcase - All 16 Characters Featured!','Please Subscribe For More TEKKEN High Level Content!\n\nWatch on Twitch: https://www.twitch.tv/tk_anakin\nTwitter: https://www.twitter.com/tk_anakin\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/tk_anakin\n\nThe TEKKEN 8 Closed Network test has concluded! I managed to try out a little bit of ALL 16 playable characters in the current build and made a highlight compilation of their attacks & tools while in Heat mode. Every character had their own unique style when it came to their utilization of the Heat System. Please enjoy the video!\n\nTimestamps\n\n00:00 Jin\n01:28 Claudio\n02:49 Xiaoyu\n03:59 Bryan\n05:10 Lili\n06:36 Kazuya\n08:02 Paul\n08:55 Jack-8\n10:30 Lars\n11:53 Asuka\n12:56 Leroy\n14:15 Jun\n15:39 King\n16:53 Law\n17:59 Hwoarang\n19:19 Nina','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bgqqdczSadM/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bgqqdczSadM/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bgqqdczSadM/default.jpg','Anakin','UU86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA','Anakin','UC86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA',7034,0,19,'2023-07-31 14:00:31.000000'),(290,'fEpA58E7bfU','Claudio is the BEST Character in TEKKEN 8...','Please Subscribe For More TEKKEN High Level Content!\n\nWatch on Twitch: https://www.twitch.tv/tk_anakin\nTwitter: https://www.twitter.com/tk_anakin\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/tk_anakin\n\nEarly impression of Claudio in TEKKEN 8 is that he may just be the best character in the game & it may not even be close.. Along with the ridiculous damage he has with all of his moves (especially in HEAT), Claudio has what seems to be a bug where after landing d/f+1 the 1,2 jabs are guaranteed afterwards. I think it\'ll be removed in the final version of the game but I definitely put it to use and enjoyed it while it lasts.\n\nDespite being very strong, Claudio was very fun and enjoyable when playing with him during the TEKKEN 8 Closed Network Test. Looking forward to playing with him more and showing you guys what he\'s capable of. Enjoy the games!','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fEpA58E7bfU/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fEpA58E7bfU/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fEpA58E7bfU/default.jpg','Anakin','UU86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA','Anakin','UC86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA',31115,0,101,'2023-07-29 13:00:26.000000'),(291,'bPBZKxoNwQc','TEKKEN 8 Cross Platform Has Arrived! Anakin Jack-8 PC Gameplay','Week 2 of the TEKKEN 8 Closed Network Test has begun! I managed to get access to the STEAM version of the game and got some matches in against people on all sorts of peripherals - PC, Console, Wired, Wi-Fi... We played them all! \n\nI also learned a couple of new things about Jack-8 that I got to mess around with. Please enjoy the games and look forward to more TEKKEN 8 uploads as the weeks continue! I plan on using every character available.','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bPBZKxoNwQc/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bPBZKxoNwQc/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bPBZKxoNwQc/default.jpg','Anakin','UU86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA','Anakin','UC86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA',17085,0,85,'2023-07-28 13:30:14.000000'),(292,'caMduHBpsPM','Paul Phoenix is STRONG ! TEKKEN 8 Gameplay','Paul Phoenix remains as the character who always has felt the same - Someone who teaches you the basics and deals high damage while implementing strong 50/50 mixups. This time, in TEKKEN 8, he has the help of HEAT mode to highlight some of his biggest strengths as a character. All the heat engagers allow him to get extremely close to his opponents where he\'s able to mix people up with his deadly low/mid game.\n\nThe matches in this video feature some of the first few games I got to play with Paul Phoenix, my very first main character in TEKKEN. I\'ll look to experiment more with his new move additions in the 2nd week of Network Testing and upload my findings. For now, enjoy the matches and I\'ll see you next time!\n\nPS - Stop thinking I am bored! LOL. That is just my normal face. I can\'t help it haha. I always enjoy playing TEKKEN very much :)','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/caMduHBpsPM/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/caMduHBpsPM/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/caMduHBpsPM/default.jpg','Anakin','UU86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA','Anakin','UC86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA',28227,0,74,'2023-07-27 15:00:32.000000'),(293,'k-QDPXFakCA','What do you think of Bryan Fury in TEKKEN 8?','First impressions of Bryan in TEKKEN 8 are that some of his key tools from TEKKEN 7 have been nerfed slightly. Mach Kick (ff+4), Northern Cross (FC df+4) and his 3+4 mid kick do not create combos on counter hit anymore. But when they take away, they always do a good job of adding compensation buffs. The first Bryan session in TEKKEN 8 was me trying to figure out what they\'ve given him in return along with some basic combo routes. I\'ll try him a little more during the second week of the Closed Network Test.. Enjoy!','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/k-QDPXFakCA/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/k-QDPXFakCA/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/k-QDPXFakCA/default.jpg','Anakin','UU86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA','Anakin','UC86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA',24342,0,145,'2023-07-25 18:00:17.000000'),(294,'uvfbw5zLjHY','First Look TEKKEN 8 Leroy Smith Gameplay! Combos, Strategies, Mixups, Etc','Taking a look at Leroy Smith in TEKKEN 8... Probably the most fun character I tried after Jack-8. It seems the developers have done a good job of making every character strong in their own way and Leroy is no exception! Take a look at what we were able to find in our first Leroy Smith session during the TEKKEN 8 Closed Network Test on PS5!','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uvfbw5zLjHY/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uvfbw5zLjHY/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uvfbw5zLjHY/default.jpg','Anakin','UU86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA','Anakin','UC86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA',28707,0,50,'2023-07-23 23:09:18.000000'),(295,'iUdjntLVBF8','Top Tier Character? MORE Anakin Jack-8 Gameplay - TEKKEN 8','Here\'s another set of matches from the TEKKEN 8 Closed Alpha Test! This time, with a little more play-time under my belt, I\'m starting to get used to the new features that Jack-8 possesses. He feels pretty strong, but as the network test continues, the players will get stronger also. We run into some better players on the first day of the test after everybody\'s had time to figure out their characters. Enjoy!','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/iUdjntLVBF8/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/iUdjntLVBF8/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/iUdjntLVBF8/default.jpg','Anakin','UU86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA','Anakin','UC86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA',64557,0,127,'2023-07-22 16:41:27.000000'),(296,'jkTrQLq7rMQ','Anakin Jack-8 Gameplay - TEKKEN 8 Closed Network Test','Some highlights & matches from the first few hours of the TEKKEN 8 Closed Network Test. Jack-8 Gamma Howl stance looking promising, complete with a guard break option when he\'s in heat. I\'ll be uploading regularly again so be sure to watch out for the upcoming vids!','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jkTrQLq7rMQ/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jkTrQLq7rMQ/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jkTrQLq7rMQ/default.jpg','Anakin','UU86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA','Anakin','UC86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA',112771,0,308,'2023-07-21 12:49:42.000000'),(297,'Hmk3ieTUMhQ','Road to Redemption - Anakin\'s Tekken Mansion Part 2','Hello everyone - Please enjoy part 2 of Road to Redemption! \n\nThis was a week-long collaboration with Red Bull Gaming & the Red Bull APC, focused primarily on helping us TEKKEN players prepare for the return to offline events after such a long break. \n\nSpecial thanks to all of the specialists at the Red Bull APC, WeNo Productions, Throwing Star Collective, and all of the players who put their full effort in to create such an amazing week-long camp.\n\nBe sure to watch Red Bull Kumite LIVE on Twitch - The event will take place November 13 & 14 in Las Vegas, NV!\n\nDon\'t forget to follow my other social channels:\n\nhttp://www.twitch.tv/tk_anakin\nhttp://www.twitter.com/tk_anakin\nhttp://www.instagram.com/tk_anakin\n\n#redbullgaming #givesyouwings #esports #athlete #tekken #mansion','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Hmk3ieTUMhQ/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Hmk3ieTUMhQ/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Hmk3ieTUMhQ/default.jpg','Anakin','UU86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA','Anakin','UC86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA',9411,0,25,'2021-11-13 15:00:12.000000'),(298,'1hcdrU4T2Yc','Road to Redemption - Anakin\'s Tekken Mansion Part 1','Hello everyone - Please enjoy part 1 of Road to Redemption! \n\nThis was a week-long collaboration with Red Bull Gaming & the Red Bull APC, focused primarily on helping us TEKKEN players prepare for the return to offline events after such a long break. \n\nSpecial thanks to all of the specialists at the Red Bull APC, WeNo Productions, Throwing Star Collective, and all of the players who put their full effort in to create such an amazing week-long camp.\n\nPlease look out for Part 2 of Road to Redemption dropping very soon. Also be sure to watch Red Bull Kumite which takes place November 13 & 14 in Las Vegas, NV!\n\nDon\'t forget to follow my other social channels:\n\nhttp://www.twitch.tv/tk_anakin\nhttp://www.twitter.com/tk_anakin\nhttp://www.instagram.com/tk_anakin\n\n#redbullgaming #givesyouwings #esports #athlete #tekken #mansion','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1hcdrU4T2Yc/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1hcdrU4T2Yc/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1hcdrU4T2Yc/default.jpg','Anakin','UU86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA','Anakin','UC86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA',16191,0,110,'2021-11-11 00:06:47.000000'),(299,'Msw8QBiK8WI','Lidia Sobieska Tekken God Omega Deathmatch','After logging 15+ hours with Lidia, we reached Tekken God Omega rank with her in the NA server. ggs to all.. My first Tekken God Omega.. hehe\n\nCheck out my other pages\nwww.twitter.com/tk_anakin\nwww.twitch.tv/tk_anakin\nwww.instagram.com/tk_anakin','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Msw8QBiK8WI/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Msw8QBiK8WI/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Msw8QBiK8WI/default.jpg','Anakin','UU86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA','Anakin','UC86uba_aEJ2MeI-eG4qNVPA',58483,0,136,'2021-03-25 02:44:18.000000'),(300,'NmX9nbVreFk','鉄拳7　STEAM版配信　明日から韓国！　2023/11/30','ライブ配信ルール\n①他のプレイヤー名を出さない\n➁暴言行為を行わない\n③キャラリクエストを行わない\n④コメント欄で会話をしない\n\nこちらの内容は極力控えていただくようお願い致します\n\nこんにちはチクリンです！\n主に鉄拳シリーズの配信を行ってます！\n\nひぐちグループ　TEAM遊INGにスポンサードして頂き、プロゲーマーとして活動しています。\n\n現在鉄拳講習会の希望者の募集を行っています！\nhttps://twitter.com/esp_nagasaki/status/1595244701312905217?s=20&t=eFuDeeaoH4iWSckVrKhBFw\n\n\nGALLERIAより最強デスクトップPCを提供して頂きました！\n\nGALLERIA UA9C-R80T\n\nCPU  Core i9-10900K\n\nグラフィックス  GeForce RTX 2080 Ti 11GB\n\nメモリ  32GB DDR4 SDRAM\n\nストレージ　1TB NVMe SSD\n\n圧倒的なスペックで配信、ゲーム共に安定した動作で行うことが出来ます！\n新ケースの使いやすさ、見た目のカッコよさも素晴らしく何より起動音が全くしないのが驚きです！！\n\nモニター　ASUS　PG248Q\n\n新しくゲーミングノートPCをご提供いただきました！\nGALLERIA XL7C-R36\nhttps://www.dospara.co.jp/5sp/shopping/detail_prime.php?mc=9853&sn=0\n\n■OS : Windows 10 Home 64 ビット\n\n■CPU　Core i7-10875H\n\n■グラフィックス　GeForce RTX 3060 6GB\n\n■メモリ　16GB DDR4 SO-DIMM\n\n■ストレージ　512GB NVMe SSD / \n\nGALLERAよりゲーミングノートPCを提供していただきました！\n軽いにも関わらず、Core i7-10875H　メモリ : 16GB DDR4 SO-DIMM　GeForce RTX 3060 6GBを搭載しており自宅ではもちろん出かけた先でも快適にゲームをプレイする事が可能です！\n\nGALLERIAで10万円以上のPCをご購入される方に3000円引きのクーポンを差し上げています。\nクーポンが欲しい方はチクリンのTwitterまでDMをお願い致します。\n\n●アンケート\nGALLERAのPC購入後のアンケート（300pt＋抽選で500pt）があります。\n「チクリンTVを見て買いました！」など僕の名前を出して頂けると、今後の活動の幅が拡がりますので、応援お願いいたします。\nhttps://www.dospara.co.jp/5info/cts_d...\n\ntwitter\nhttps://twitter.com/chikurintut\n\nアケコン：パンテラ初期\nボタン：ゲーマーズフィンガー\nレバー：ノビレバー（プロ仕様）','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NmX9nbVreFk/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NmX9nbVreFk/mqdefau