Pirate King Monkey D Luffy from One Piece [Showa Draws]','海賊の王に俺はなる！\n[I\'m gonna be King of the Pirates]\n\nThe Gum Gum Fruit eating Rubber captain of the Staw Hat Grand Fleet.\n\n\nI\'m gonna draw him!!\n\nSafe to Say that I am really getting in to this long running manga and anime series.  As it stands, I\'m doing my best to catch up.  I hope you guys like this time lapsed paint video.\n\n\nI do commission art to:\nhttp://artistree.io/request/showa60 \n\nYou can also donate to my Ko-fi:\nhttp://ko-fi.com/showasama \n\n\nYour support means a lot\n\nMy Instagram\nhttp://instagream.com/showa60\n\n\n#onepiece #manga #speedpaint #anime #digitalart #blackartist #commissionsopen','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Xt81bRFBpF4/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Xt81bRFBpF4/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Xt81bRFBpF4/default.jpg','Showa60','UUp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw','Showa60','UCp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw',115,0,0,'2023-11-28 08:47:06.000000'),(7020,'2dP8iTcpcN4','Vegeta Vs Broly Reaction Video','YouTubers, Blank Boy, and Codnamesuper are creating a three-part commentary series and I\'m here for it.  Are you?\n\nMovie: DragonBall Super Broly [Toei/Bird Studio/Toei Animation/20th Century FOX]\n\nBlank Boy\'s Video\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2-e3h8Z2yiU&t=18s\n\nWhere to go for Blank and Super\'s content:\n@blankboy_ \n@Codenamesuper \n@superblank \n\n\nI do commission art to:\nhttp://artistree.io/request/showa60 \n\nYou can also donate to my Ko-fi:\nhttp://ko-fi.com/showasama\n\nInstagram: showa60\n\n#dragonballsuper #anime #broly #comedy #blankboy #codnamesuper #nerd #manga #akiratoriyama','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2dP8iTcpcN4/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2dP8iTcpcN4/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2dP8iTcpcN4/default.jpg','Showa60','UUp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw','Showa60','UCp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw',53,0,0,'2023-11-25 01:01:39.000000'),(7021,'L1egMgFTP1c','The Donblaster is now in Japan! #tokusatsu #supersentai #donbrothers #memorialedition','','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/L1egMgFTP1c/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/L1egMgFTP1c/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/L1egMgFTP1c/default.jpg','Showa60','UUp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw','Showa60','UCp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw',73,0,1,'2023-11-24 05:38:36.000000'),(7022,'7Ca13LX-ONE','Dragon Con and Anime Weekend Atlanta 2023','After ATL Comic Con, Momo Con, and Ranger Stop Atlanta, There were 2 more cons in Atlanta i attended.  Of course I enjoyed myself when I showed up.  Dragon Con made up the bulk of this log, while AWA was celebrated in a day for me.\n\nSongs Used:\nKen\'s Theme [Street Fighter 5 OST]\nOne Who Stands in Our Way [Xenoblade OST]\nSkullMan Theme [Rockman Arranged Album]\nLuffy The Trusted Man [One Piece TV Animation OST]\nDouble Dimension Battle [Legend of Legacy OST]\n市子・ツキまくり人生 [Happy Enertgy Assortment OST][Changed due to  Content ID]\nGrendeizer U PV theme [Tanaka Kouhei/田中公平]\n\n\nI do commission art to:\nhttp://artistree.io/request/showa60 \n\nYou can also donate to my Ko-fi:\nhttp://ko-fi.com/showasama\n\n#dragoncon2023 #animeweekendatlanta2023 #cosplay','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7Ca13LX-ONE/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7Ca13LX-ONE/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7Ca13LX-ONE/default.jpg','Showa60','UUp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw','Showa60','UCp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw',113,0,0,'2023-11-19 20:22:19.000000'),(7023,'I1G7mBu8gno','The Two Best shows on Netflix  #onepieceliveaction #scottpilgrimtakesoff #netflix #anime #tokusatsu','','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/I1G7mBu8gno/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/I1G7mBu8gno/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/I1G7mBu8gno/default.jpg','Showa60','UUp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw','Showa60','UCp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw',14,0,0,'2023-11-19 03:42:18.000000'),(7024,'r2Mc6iVHZrg','Congratulations Peter Cullen #transformers #optimusprime #toonami #lifetimeachievementaward','','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/r2Mc6iVHZrg/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/r2Mc6iVHZrg/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/r2Mc6iVHZrg/default.jpg','S