ant Now #tokusatsu #ultraman #netflix #gokaiger #山田裕貴 #supersentai','','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5x4lwN4GoUM/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5x4lwN4GoUM/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5x4lwN4GoUM/default.jpg','Showa60','UUp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw','Showa60','UCp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw',33,0,0,'2023-11-09 23:57:15.000000'),(7031,'vjoesCXLplU','Let\'s Just enjoy  being a nerd. #tokusatsu #anime #gaming #comics #otaku #cosplay','','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vjoesCXLplU/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vjoesCXLplU/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vjoesCXLplU/default.jpg','Showa60','UUp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw','Showa60','UCp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw',111,0,1,'2023-11-06 03:09:56.000000'),(7032,'5y3JGvraq8s','When Nanami was put on a T-shirt #anime #jujutsukaisen #nanamikento #sorcererlivesmatter','','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5y3JGvraq8s/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5y3JGvraq8s/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5y3JGvraq8s/default.jpg','Showa60','UUp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw','Showa60','UCp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw',609,0,2,'2023-11-04 05:53:39.000000'),(7033,'JbAv8oKcp7M','This Play from Celsys is Dumb #clipstudiopaint #celsys #digitalart #cspver2.0','','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JbAv8oKcp7M/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JbAv8oKcp7M/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JbAv8oKcp7M/default.jpg','Showa60','UUp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw','Showa60','UCp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw',52,0,0,'2023-11-03 21:11:43.000000'),(7034,'APRPgHGojEo','My AWA experience coming soon. #animeweekendatlanta2020 #cosplay','','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/APRPgHGojEo/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/APRPgHGojEo/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/APRPgHGojEo/default.jpg','Showa60','UUp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw','Showa60','UCp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw',46,0,0,'2023-10-30 18:25:43.000000'),(7035,'3uNS4C-KXhI','Tae Kim\'s Grammar Guide needed more pitch accent. #japanese #pitchaccent #japaneseimmersion','','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3uNS4C-KXhI/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3uNS4C-KX