/TPgdnO7oM6k/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TPgdnO7oM6k/default.jpg','gc_mini','UUD4B0EjyC_ZcYc-zdEN1Yow','gc_mini','UCD4B0EjyC_ZcYc-zdEN1Yow',17,0,0,'2023-10-21 00:55:16.000000'),(8219,'3In7dRvxMUI','Minami Wachi First time visiting Harada\'s Bar','This Harada\'s Bar...\n\nShe can feel ghosts, likes saunas&sharks, is shy around new people. She thinks it’s cheating if her partner has physical relationships with someone else. She is somewhere between cleanly person and germaphobe, and doesn’t really dream about marriage…\nMinami Wachi visiting the bar for the first time!\n────　○   ─────────────\n👱Guest & Cast.\n✒Minami Wachi\nhttps://twitter.com/wacchime____\n✒Katsuhiro Harada（Barkeeper）\nhttps://twitter.com/Harada_TEKKEN\n✒Taketora（Super Takoyaki Chef）\nhttps://twitter.com/taketora0131\n✒Harada\'s Bar\nhttps://twitter.com/HaradasBar\n────　○   ─────────────\n◆Conditions for Harada\'s Bar◆\nIf you violate any of these rules you may be reported, blocked or have your comment deleted by moderators.\n\n◇Commenting Rules◇\nThe following are the rules for commenting.\nIf you commit any of the violations below here or on another channel it may lead to being reported, blocked or having your comments deleted.\n\n・Slandering, insults, abusive language, rough language, or vulgar language\n・Lack of respect or care for the cast, producers, or other viewers\n・Leave comments for advertising purposes\n・Impersonate celebrities or other famous people (Accounts using their icons and name)\n・Addressing celebrities or famous people in a disrespectful manner (Nicknames are fine)\n・Comments with the intention of spoiling or ruining games for others\n・Giving excessive instructions or commands\n・Overabundance of self-obsessed comments\n・Comments that have nothing to do with the program or channel\n\nWe would like to ask for everyone\'s cooperation.\n────　○   ─────────────\n【Executive producer / 企画・構成・総合演出】\n世名 好晃 Yoshiteru Sena\nMallet of Luck Corporation\n────　○   ─────────────\n【Production Management / 著作・製作】\nMallet of Luck Corporation\n────　○   ─────────────\n#HaradasBar #MinamiWachi #sauna #gravure #Horipro #KatsuhiroHarada #TEKKEN #TEKKEN8 #playStation #esports #takoyaki','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3In7dRvxMUI/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3In7dRvxMUI/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3In7dRvxMUI/default.jpg','Harada\'s Bar・はらだのばぁー','UUXJWC1-8gqQ4gZhgRkRyFXA','Harada\'s Bar・はらだのばぁー','UCXJWC1-8gqQ4gZhgRkRyFXA',8935,0,9,'2023-11-23 00:16:04.000000'),(8220,'DuiuTa9UWyc','「今まで食べた たこ焼きの中で一番美味しい！」(番組ゲスト)と言わせる “スーパーたこ焼きシェフ” 武虎の「超絶品！ たこ焼き」パーフェクト・レシピ初公開！','「今まで食べた たこ焼きの中で一番美味しいです」\n｢はらだのばぁー｣に来店する全てのゲストが言うぐらい美味しいのが「武虎流たこ焼き」\n\n“スーパーたこ焼きシェフ”武虎が作る 超絶品たこ焼き🐙のパーフェクト・レシピを初公開！\nたこ焼きを上手に作れると人気者になれますよ(^^)/\n\n────　○   ─────────────\n🐙「THE大阪たこ焼ソース」を買う / Buy takoyaki sauce.\nhttps://shop.ikari-s.co.jp/products/detail/237\n────　○   ─────────────\n🏢Special Support provided by イカリソース/IKARI SAUSE\nhttps://www.ikari-s.co.jp/brand/osaka_takoyaki.html\n────　○   ─────────────\n🐙武虎流たこ焼きレシピ\n[生地の作り方]\n・小麦粉100g\n・出汁(カツオ・コンブ)600〜900mlで好きな固さに\n・山芋(パウダーでもOK)大さじ2杯\n・卵2個\nこれを基本に好きなようにアレンジしてください\n※6～12時間 冷蔵庫で寝かすとよいです\n※この分量で約40個のたこ焼きが作れます\n\n[焼き方]\n油はオリーブオイルがおすすめ\n↓\n油は穴だけではなくプレート全体にひく\n↓\n最初に天かすを穴の半分まで入れる\n↓\nその天かすを少量の生地で固めて食感を作る\n↓\nタコはメスダコがおすすめ\n↓\n紅ショウガは味が強いので1穴に3粒程度がおすすめですがお好みで\n↓\nネギは万能ねぎ/小分けねぎなど緑色の細いねぎを使用\n↓\n追い天かすをしたら生地をプレートいっぱいに投入\n↓\nキャノーラ油を使った天かすを使うと油っぽくなく胃もたれしずらくなる\n↓\nたこ焼きをひっくり返す(回す)順番は必ず一番火力の強い真ん中から\n↓\n端っこの穴は火力が弱い場合が多いので注意\n↓\n外が焼けてきたら回し初めてOK それまでは我慢！\n↓\n穴の外に はみ出ている生地を穴の中にかき集める\n↓\n穴と穴がくっついていると回せないのでしっかりと穴の中に集める\n↓\n最初は90度だけ回転！ 一気に180度回さないのがコツ\n↓\n90度回転を3,4回かけて 丸くすると良い\n↓\nこんがり焼けたら ｢イカリTHE大阪たこ焼ソース｣をかけて完成！\nhttps://shop.ikari-s.co.jp/products/detail/237\n────　○   ─────────────\nたこ焼き作れる、お父さんは人気者。\nたこ焼き作れる、お姉ちゃんは人気者。\nたこ焼き作れる、僕は人気者。\n\nお父さん・お母さん・お子さん・兄弟・おじいちゃん・おばあちゃん・お友達\nと 今度の休日は“たこパ”で笑顔に。\nたこ焼き作れる人は人気者になれるんです。\n────　○   ─────────────\n【キャスト / Cast.】\n✒武虎・Taketora（スーパーたこ焼き職人・Super Takoyaki Chef）Twitter\nhttps://twitter.com/taketora0131\n✒Harada\'s Bar（はらだのばぁー）Twitter\nhttps://twitter.com/HaradasBar\n────　○   ─────────────\n【Executive producer / 企画・構成・総合演出】\n世名 好晃 Yoshiteru Sena\nMallet of Luck Corporation\n────　○   ─────────────\n【Production Management / 著作・製作】\nMallet of Luck Corporation\n────　○   ─────────────\n#たこ焼き #Takoyaki #イカリソース #IKARISAUCE #はらだのばぁー #HaradasBar #原田勝弘 #KatsuhiroHarada #鉄拳7 #Tekken7 #鉄拳8 #Tekken8 #プレステ #playstation #eスポーツ #eSports #Taketora #武虎','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/DuiuTa9UWyc/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/DuiuTa9UWyc/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/DuiuTa9UWyc/default.jpg','Harada\'s Bar・はらだのばぁー','UUXJWC1-8gqQ4gZhgRkRyFXA','Harada\'s Bar・はらだのばぁー','UCXJWC1-8gqQ4gZhgRkRyFXA',42433,0,8,'2023-11-02 13:00:20.000000'),(8221,'dZkKWR3T9dc','\'It had the same release date as our rival\'s title!','This Harada\'s Bar...\n\nHarada speaks for the first time!\n\'It had the same release date as our rival\'s title!\n────　○   ─────────────\n👱Guest & Cast.\n✒Kakeru（IBUSHIGIN）\nhttps://twitter.com/UzuraQuail86\n✒Tokido（ROHTO Z!）\nhttps://twitter.com/tokidoki77\n✒Katsuhiro Harada（Barkeeper）\nhttps://twitter.com/Harada_TEKKEN\n────　○   ─────────────\n🍸Location.\n✒Bar flare Ebisu\nhttps://flare.tokyo/\n────　○   ─────────────\n◆Conditions for Harada\'s Bar◆\nIf you violate any of these rules you may be reported, blocked or have your comment deleted by moderators.\n\n◇Commenting Rules◇\nThe following are the rules for commenting.\nIf you commit any of the violations below here or on another channel it may lead to being reported, blocked or having your comments deleted.\n\n・Slandering, insults, abusive language, rough language, or vulgar language\n・Lack of respect or care for the cast, producers, or other viewers\n・Leave comments for advertising purposes\n・Impersonate celebrities or other famous people (Accounts using their icons and name)\n・Addressing celebrities or famous people in a disrespectful manner (Nicknames are fine)\n・Comments with the intention of spoiling or ruining games for other