ve language, rough language, or vulgar language\n・Lack of respect or care for the cast, producers, or other viewers\n・Leave comments for advertising purposes\n・Impersonate celebrities or other famous people (Accounts using their icons and name)\n・Addressing celebrities or famous people in a disrespectful manner (Nicknames are fine)\n・Comments with the intention of spoiling or ruining games for others\n・Giving excessive instructions or commands\n・Overabundance of self-obsessed comments\n・Comments that have nothing to do with the program or channel\n\nWe would like to ask for everyone\'s cooperation.\n────　○   ─────────────\n✒Harada\'s Bar（はらだのばぁー）X\nhttps://twitter.com/HaradasBar\n✒Katsuhiro Harada（原田 勝弘）X\nhttps://twitter.com/Harada_TEKKEN\n✒EVO X\nhttps://twitter.com/EVO\n────　○   ─────────────\n【Executive producer / 企画・構成・総合演出】\n世名 好晃 Yoshiteru Sena\nMallet of Luck Corporation\n────　○   ─────────────\n【Production Management / 著作・製作】\nMallet of Luck Corporation\n────　○   ─────────────\n#INZONE #HaradasBar #KatsuhiroHarada #TastySteve #Tekken8 #EVO #playstation #Tekken7 #eSports #MichaelMurray','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NK9YO26Wefk/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NK9YO26Wefk/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NK9YO26Wefk/default.jpg','Harada\'s Bar・はらだのばぁー','UUXJWC1-8gqQ4gZhgRkRyFXA','Harada\'s Bar・はらだのばぁー','UCXJWC1-8gqQ4gZhgRkRyFXA',40746,0,33,'2023-08-28 01:36:42.000000'),(8225,'TbjCTUiLtEY','リーク？ ／ Leaked? (English is available in the overview section.)','最終日前日 実は こんな事がありました！\n\nEVO2023の現地にいるマスター・原田からコメントが届きました！\nComments were received from Bareeper Harada, who is on site at EVO 2023!\n\n【English Translation】\n◆Harada：\nI\'m at EVO2023 right now.\nLas Vegas is Saturday. Still qualifying for EVO 2023.\nI came here for lunch.\nYesterday (local Friday) there was a leak!\nBy the time you watch this, though, everyone will know what it is.\n\n◆Michael：\nYou\'re smiling now, but not yesterday.\n\n◆Nakatsu(Kouhei Ikeda)：\nThat\'s right!\n\n◆Harada：\nI\'m still very angry. I\'m laughing, though.\nThe people who leaked it say it\'s a bug.\nIt can\'t be.\nWell, that\'s the situation now.\nBut I am trying my best to make \"Tekken\" more exciting.\nI believe that Harada\'s Bar will be showing various videos of EVO2023.\nEnjoy. I will do my best!','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TbjCTUiLtEY/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TbjCTUiLtEY/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TbjCTUiLtEY/default.jpg','Harada\'s Bar・はらだのばぁー','UUXJWC1-8gqQ4gZhgRkRyFXA','Harada\'s Bar・はらだのばぁー','UCXJWC1-8gqQ4gZhgRkRyFXA',8577,0,107,'2023-08-07 00:54:32.000000'),(8226,'7V7S6owdf20','A reporter\'s serious TEKKEN 7 battle!','This Harada\'s Bar...\n\nA reporter\'s serious TEKKEN 7 battle!\nAn embarrassing punishment game awaits you (^o^).\n────　○   ─────────────\nCast.\n✒Miu Hisatomi（Nagasaki Broadcasting Corporation Reporter）\nhttps://twitter.com/miu_hisatomi\n✒Shion（Cosplay）\nhttps://twitter.com/Shioncos\n✒Katsuhiro Harada（Barkeeper of Harada\'s Bar）\nhttps://twitter.com/Harada_TEKKEN\n✒Taketora（Super TakoyakiChef of Harada\'s Bar）\nhttps://twitter.com/taketora0131\n✒Harada\'s Bar（はらだのばぁー）Twitter\nhttps://twitter.com/HaradasBar\n────　○   ─────────────\n◆Conditions for Harada\'s Bar◆\nIf you violate any of these rules you may be reported, blocked or have your comment deleted by moderators.\n\n◇Commenting Rules◇\nThe following are the rules for commenting.\nIf you commit any of the violations below here or on another channel it may lead to being reported, blocked or having your comments deleted.\n\n・Slandering, insults, abusive language, rough language, or vulgar language\n・Lack of respect or care for the cast, producers, or other viewers\n・Leave comments for advertising purposes\n・Impersonate celebrities or other famous people (Accounts using their icons and name)\n・Addressing celebrities or famous people in a disrespectful manner (Nicknames are fine)\n・Comments with the intention of spoiling or ruining games for others\n・Giving excessive instructions or commands\n・Overabundance of self-obsessed comments\n・Comments that have nothing to do with the program or channel\n\nWe would like to ask for everyone\'s cooperation.\n────　○   ─────────────\n【Executive producer / 企画・構成・総合演出】\n世名 好晃 Yoshiteru Sena\nMallet of Luck Corporation\n────　○   ─────────────\n【Production Management / 著作・製作】\nMallet of Luck Corporation\n────　○   ─────────────\n#HaradasBar #KatsuhiroHarada #MiuHisatomi #miumiu #Shion #Tekken #Tekken7 #playstation #Tekken8 #eSports #Takoyaki #femaleTVannouncer #NBCeSports','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7V7S6owdf20/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7V7S6owdf20/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7V7S6owdf20/default.jpg','Harada\'s Bar・はらだのばぁー','UUXJWC1-8gqQ4gZhgRkRyFXA','Harada\'s Bar・はらだのばぁー','UCXJWC1-8gqQ4gZhgRkRyFXA',28237,0,14,'2023-08-01 11:00:07.000000'),(8227,'Oyr7-_n5tOU','武虎流 たこ焼きParty！ ／ Taketora Style Takoyaki Party','たこ焼き作れる、僕は人気者。\n\n先日“シークレット・ライヴ”的に開催した「武虎流 たこパ」の様子を公開🐙\n“スーパーたこ焼きシェフ”が「たこパ」すると こうなります！\n\nThe \'Taketora Style Takoyaki Party\' was held as a \'secret show\' recently.\n────　○   ─────────────\n🐙「THE大阪たこ焼ソース」を買う / Buy takoyaki sauce.\nhttps://shop.ikari-s.co.jp/products/detail/237\n────　○   ─────────────\n🏢Special Support provided by イカリソース/IKARI SAUSE\nhttps://www.ikari-s.co.jp/brand/osaka_takoyaki.html\n────　○   ─────────────\n🐙武虎流たこ焼きレシピ\n油はオリーブオイルがおすすめ\n↓\n油は穴だけではなくプレート全体にひく\n↓\n最初に天かすを穴の半分まで入れる\n↓\nその天かすを少量の生地で固めて食感を作る\n↓\nタコはメスダコがおすすめ\n↓\n紅ショウガは味が強いので1穴に3粒程度がおすすめですがお好みで\n↓\nネギは万能ねぎ/小分けねぎなど緑色の細いねぎを使用\n↓\n追い天かすをしたら生地をプレートいっぱいに投入\n↓\nキャノーラ油を使った天かすを使うと油っぽくなく胃もたれしずらくなる\n↓\nたこ焼きをひっくり返す(回す)順番は必ず一番火力の強い真ん中から\n↓\n端っこの穴は火力が弱い場合が多いので注意\n↓\n外が焼けてきたら回し初めてOK それまでは我慢！\n↓\n穴の外に はみ出ている生地を穴の中にかき集める\n↓\n穴と穴がくっついていると回せないのでしっかりと穴の中に集める\n↓\n最初は90度だけ回転！ 一気に180度回さないのがコツ\n↓\n90度回転を3,4回かけて 丸くすると良い\n↓\nこんがり焼けたら ｢イカリTHE大阪たこ焼ソース｣をかけて完成！\n────　○   ─────────────\nたこ焼き作れる、お父さんは人気者。\nたこ焼き作れる、お姉ちゃんは人気者。\nたこ焼き作れる、僕は人気者。\n\nお父さん・お母さん・お子さん・兄弟・おじいちゃん・おばあちゃん・お友達\nと 今度の休日は“たこパ”で笑顔に。\nたこ焼き作れる人は人気者になれるんです。\n────　○   ─────────────\n【キャスト / Cast.】\n✒武虎・Taketora（スーパーたこ焼き職人・Super Takoyaki Chef）Twitter\nhttps://twitter.com/taketora0131\n✒Harada\'s Bar（はらだのばぁー）Twitter\nhttps://twitter.com/HaradasBar\n────　○   ─────────────\n【Executive producer / 企画・構成・総合演出】\n世名 好晃 Yoshiteru Sena\nMallet of Luck Corporation\n────　○   ─────────────\n【Production Management / 著作・製作】\nMallet of Luck Corporation\n────　○   ─────────────\n#たこ焼き #Takoyaki #イカリソース #IKARISAUCE #はらだのばぁー #HaradasBar #原田勝弘 #KatsuhiroHarada #鉄拳7 #Tekken7 #鉄拳8 #Tekken8 #プレステ #playstation #eスポーツ #eSports','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Oyr7-_n5tOU/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Oyr7-_n5tOU/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Oyr7-_n5tOU/default.jpg','Harada\'s Bar・はらだのばぁー','UUXJWC1-8gqQ4gZhgRkRyFXA','Harada\'s Bar・はらだのばぁー','UCXJWC1-8gqQ4gZhgRkRyFXA',14827,0,14,'2023-07-28 23:05:14.000000'),(8228,'kKp_1CXYqfk','Life changing moment for a reporter','This Harada\'s Bar...\n\nThe first game I ever played was Tekken.\n\nTweeting “I want to be on Harada’s Bar” led a reporter to be on the show! She and a cosplayer, 4th time on the show, are the guests! We don’t know what’s going to happen…\n────　○   ─────────────\nCast.\n✒Miu Hisatomi（Nagasaki Broadcasting Corporation Reporter）\nhttps://twitter.com/miu_hisatomi\n✒Shion（Cosplay）\nhttps://twitter.com/Shioncos\n✒Katsuhiro Harada（Barkeeper of Harada\'s Bar）\nhttps://twitter.com/Harada_TEKKEN\n✒Taketora（Super TakoyakiChef of Harada\'s Bar）\nhttps://twitter.com/taketora0131\n✒Harada\'s Bar（はらだのばぁー）Twitter\nhttps://twitter.com/HaradasBar\n────　○   ─────────────\n◆Conditions for Harada\'s Bar◆\nIf you violate any of these rules you may be reported, blocked or have your comment deleted by moderators.\n\n◇Commenting Rules◇\nThe following are the rules for commenting.\nIf you commit any of the violations below here or on another channel it may lead to being reported, blocked or having your comments deleted.\n\n・Slandering, insults, abusive language, rough language, or vulgar language\n・Lack of respect or care for the cast, producers, or other viewers\n・Leave comments for advertising purposes\n・Impersonate celebrities or other famous people (Accounts using their icons and name)\n・Addressing celebrities or famous people in a disrespectful manner (Nicknames are fine)\n・Comments with the intention of spoiling or ruining games for others\n・Giving excessive instructions or commands\n・Overabundance of self-obsessed comments\n・Comments that have nothing to do with the program or channel\n\nWe would like to ask for everyone\'s cooperation.\n────　○   ─────────────\n【Executive producer / 企画・構成・総合演出】\n世名 好晃 Yoshiteru Sena\nMallet of Luck Corporation\n────　○   ─────────────\n【Production Management / 著作・製作】\nMallet of Luck Corporation\n────　○   ─────────────\n#HaradasBar #KatsuhiroHarada #MiuHisatomi #miumiu #Shion #Tekken #Tekken7 #playstation #Tekken8 #eSports #Takoyaki #femaleTVannouncer #NBCeSports','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kKp_1CXYqfk/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kKp_1CXYqfk/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kKp_1CXYqfk/default.jpg','Harada\'s Bar・はらだのばぁー','UUXJWC1-8gqQ4gZhgRkRyFXA','Harada\'s Bar・はらだのばぁー','UCXJWC1-8gqQ4gZhgRkRyFXA',28384,0,15,'2023-07-25 10:00:08.000000'),(8229,'amu0zz5DSRk','もしも外山さんがマスターだったら。。。／ If Toyama-san were a Barkeeper','Bokeh Game Studio・外山 圭一郎さん／『野狗子: Slitterhead』(現在制作中) が｢はらだのばぁー｣のマスターだったら。。。\n多分 こんな感じ！\nIf Toyama-san were a Barkeeper\nIt goes like this.\n────　○   ─────────────\n📺安田文彦x柴田誠ｘ外山圭一郎の映像公開中\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VVt_YW6t08s\n────　○   ─────────────\n✒Harada\'s Bar（はらだのばぁー）Twitter\nhttps://twitter.com/HaradasBar\n✒Keiichiro Toyama（外山 圭一郎）Twitter\nhttps://twitter.com/K_Toyama\n✒Bokeh Game Studio（ボーカーゲームスタジオ）Twitter\nhttps://twitter.com/BokehGameStudio\n────　○   ─────────────\n【Executive producer / 企画・構成・総合演出】\nYoshiteru Sena\nMallet of Luck Corporation\n────　○   ─────────────\n【Production Management / 著作・製作】\nMallet of Luck Corporation\n────　○   ─────────────\n#原田勝弘 #KatsuhiroHarada #外山圭一郎 #KeiichiroToyama #鉄拳 #Tekken #Tekken8 #鉄拳8 #はらだのばぁー #HaradasBar #サイレントヒル #SILENTHILL #野狗子 #Slitterhead #Yakushi #SIREN #eスポーツ #eSports','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/amu0zz5DSRk/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/amu0zz5DSRk/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/amu0zz5DSRk/default.jpg','Harada\'s Bar・はらだのばぁー','UUXJWC1-8gqQ4gZhgRkRyFXA','Harada\'s Bar・はらだのばぁー','UCXJWC1-8gqQ4gZhgRkRyFXA',9428,0,10,'2023-07-08 09:06:50.000000'),(8230,'CebP4LyLL_o','【絶品たこ焼き】声優界の“スーパーたこ焼きシェフ”武虎 / The \"Super Takoyaki Chef\" of the voice-over industry, Taketora.','おなじみ｢はらだのばぁー｣の名物！\n声優界の“スーパーたこ焼きシェフ”武虎が作る 絶品たこ焼き🐙の出来上がるまでを初公開！\n＆レシピも公開!!\n\nA well-known specialty of Harada\'s Bar!\nThe first public showing of the process of making the exquisite takoyaki🐙 made by Taketora-san, the \'super takoyaki chef\' of the voice-over world!\n────　○   ─────────────\n🐙「THE大阪たこ焼ソース」を買う / Buy takoyaki sauce.\nhttps://shop.ikari-s.co.jp/products/detail/237\n────　○   ─────────────\n🏢Special Support provided by イカリソース/IKARI SAUSE\nhttps://www.ikari-s.co.jp/brand/osaka_takoyaki.html\n────　○   ─────────────\n🐙武虎流たこ焼きレシピ\n油はオリーブオイルがおすすめ\n↓\n油は穴だけではなくプレート全体にひく\n↓\n最初に天かすを穴の半分まで入れる\n↓\nその天かすを少量の生地で固めて食感を作る\n↓\nタコはメスダコがおすすめ\n↓\n紅ショウガは味が強いので1穴に3粒程度がおすすめですがお好みで\n↓\nネギは万能ねぎ/小分けねぎなど緑色の細いねぎを使用\n↓\n追い天かすをしたら生地をプレートいっぱいに投入\n↓\nキャノーラ油を使った天かすを使うと油っぽくなく胃もたれしずらくなる\n↓\nたこ焼きをひっくり返す(回す)順番は必ず一番火力の強い真ん中から\n↓\n端っこの穴は火力が弱い場合が多いので注意\n↓\n外が焼けてきたら回し初めてOK それまでは我慢！\n↓\n穴の外に はみ出ている生地を穴の中にかき集める\n↓\n穴と穴がくっついていると回せないのでしっかりと穴の中に集める\n↓\n最初は90度だけ回転！ 一気に180度回さないのがコツ\n↓\n90度回転を3,4回かけて 丸くすると良い\n↓\nこんがり焼けたら ｢イカリTHE大阪たこ焼ソース｣をかけて完成！\n────　○   ─────────────\nたこ焼き作れる、お父さんは人気者。\nたこ焼き作れる、お姉ちゃんは人気者。\nたこ焼き作れる、僕は人気者。\n\nお父さん・お母さん・お子さん・兄弟・おじいちゃん・おばあちゃん・お友達\nと 今度の休日は“たこパ”で笑顔に。\nたこ焼き作れる人は人気者になれるんです。\n────　○   ─────────────\n【キャスト / Cast.】\n✒武虎・Taketora（スーパーたこ焼き職人・Super Takoyaki Chef）Twitter\nhttps://twitter.com/taketora0131\n✒Harada\'s Bar（はらだのばぁー）Twitter\nhttps://twitter.com/HaradasBar\n────　○   ─────────────\n【Executive producer / 企画・構成・総合演出】\n世名 好晃 Yoshiteru Sena\nMallet of Luck Corporation\n────　○   ─────────────\n【Production Management / 著作・製作】\nMallet of Luck Corporation\n────　○   ─────────────\n#たこ焼き #Takoyaki #イカリソース #IKARISAUCE #はらだのばぁー #HaradasBar #原田勝弘 #KatsuhiroHarada #鉄拳7 #Tekken7 #鉄拳8 #Tekken8 #プレステ #playstation #eスポーツ #eSports','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/CebP4LyLL_o/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/CebP4LyLL_o/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/CebP4LyLL_o/default.jpg','Harada\'s Bar・はらだのばぁー','UUXJWC1-8gqQ4gZhgRkRyFXA','Harada\'s Bar・はらだのばぁー','UCXJWC1-8gqQ4gZhgRkRyFXA',19148,0,31,'2023-07-01 00:20:35.000000'),(8231,'hJEhuxyLAK0','Tokido\'s move is completed.','This Harada\'s Bar...\nEp-2 of “Tokido is moving!”\nFinally settled.\n────　○   ─────────────\nCast.\n✒Tokido（Rohto Z!）\nhttps://twitter.com/tokidoki77\n✒Katsuhiro Harada（Barkeeper of Harada\'s Bar）\nhttps://twitter.com/Harada_TEKKEN\n✒Harada\'s Bar（はらだのばぁー）Twitter\nhttps://twitter.com/HaradasBar\n────　○   ─────────────\nProperty Research.\n✒T-BRIDGE\nMail：info@tb-inc.co.jp\nweb：https://tb-inc.co.jp\nnote：It will be easier if you tell them that you saw Harada\'s Bar.\n────　○   ─────────────\n◆Conditions for Harada\'s Bar◆\nIf you violate any of these rules you may be reported, blocked or have your comment deleted by moderators.\n\n◇Commenting Rules◇\nThe following are the rules for commenting.\nIf you commit any of the violations below here or on another channel it may lead to being reported, blocked or having your comments deleted.\n\n・Slandering, insults, abusive language, rough language, or vulgar language\n・Lack of respect or care for the cast, producers, or other viewers\n・Leave comments for advertising purposes\n・Impersonate celebrities or other famous people (Accounts using their icons and name)\n・Addressing celebrities or famous people in a disrespectful manner (Nicknames are fine)\n・Comments with the intention of spoiling or ruining games for others\n・Giving excessive instructions or commands\n・Overabundance of self-obsessed comments\n・Comments that have nothi