ica','UC_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw',427373,0,1270,'2023-12-19 14:00:08.000000'),(9234,'JST4vc0_GGk','MOBILE SUIT GUNDAM BATTLE OPERATION 2 – Narrative Gundam [C-Packs]','Jona Basta\'s Narrative Gundam [C-Packs] is now available! \n\nMobile Suit Gundam Battle Operation 2 is a free-to-play mech simulation combat game where you can fight in up to 6v6 matches against other players. \n\nPlay now: https://bo2.ggame.jp/en/\n\n#GBO2','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JST4vc0_GGk/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JST4vc0_GGk/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JST4vc0_GGk/default.jpg','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UU_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UC_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw',11176,0,33,'2023-12-19 02:00:31.000000'),(9235,'X1dgCe1jDYg','ARMORED CORE VI FIRES OF RUBICON — Ranked Matchmaking Update Trailer','Dominate in ranked online matchmaking and ascend the leaderboard in ARMORED CORE VI FIRES OF RUBICON! Patch 1.05 releases 12/19 — Get ready, Ravens.\n\n● Battle other players in ranked online matchmaking\n● Carve your name into the ranked leaderboard\n● Enhance your AC loadout with new parts\n● Take the fight to new places with new PVP maps\n● Personalize your nameplate to make your mark on the battlefield\n\nPlay today on PlayStation, Xbox, or PC: www.armoredcore6.com\n\n● Pilot your mech in fast-paced, omni-directional battles, taking advantage of your mech’s mobility both on land and in the air to ensure victory across massive stages.\n● Explore a breadth of playstyles and combat styles by customizing your mech’s buildout between missions. Pick and equip your preferred parts via a robust customization system that can dramatically alter your play strategy, maneuverability, and battle style.\n● Deploy a wide variety of offensive and defensive tactics at close and long range to take down powerful enemy bosses.\n\n#ARMOREDCORE #FIRESOFRUBICON\nFollow Armored Core:\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/armoredcore/ \nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/armoredcore/ \nTwitter: https://twitter.com/armoredcore \n\nFollow Bandai Namco Entertainment America:\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/bandainamcous\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/BandaiNamcoUS\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/BandaiNamcoUS\nTwitch: http://www.twitch.tv/bandainamcous','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/X1dgCe1jDYg/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/X1dgCe1jDYg/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/X1dgCe1jDYg/default.jpg','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UU_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UC_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw',121902,0,561,'2023-12-18 14:00:26.000000'),(9236,'st3346B9vGg','Season\'s Greetings, everyone! Thief is here to put some holiday cheer in (...or out of?) #SANDLAND!','He\'s sacrificing his hairstyle for the spirit of the season!\n\nWishlist on PlayStation:\nhttps://store.playstation.com/concept/10005459/\nWishlist on Steam:\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/app/1979440/SAND_LAND/','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/st3346B9vGg/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/st3346B9vGg/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/st3346B9vGg/default.jpg','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UU_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UC_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw',6701,0,14,'2023-12-15 22:50:14.000000'),(9237,'yq3Ndozm_0c','Park Beyond – Chicken Run: Dawn of the Nugget Launch Tailer','Can you create a theme park where chicken-obsessed visitors have the best day of their lives? The newest #ParkBeyond challenge be-hens here! 🐔🏃🎢\nChicken Run: Dawn of the Nugget DLC is out now. Watch the movie on Netflix and then peck it up today! \n\nFollow Bandai Namco Entertainment: \nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/bandainamcous\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/BandaiNamcoUS\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/BandaiNamcoUS\nTwitch: http://www.twitch.tv/bandainamcous','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/yq3Ndozm_0c/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/yq3Ndozm_0c/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/yq3Ndozm_0c/default.jpg','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UU_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UC_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw',10569,0,35,'2023-12-15 15:00:56.000000'),(9238,'KX3It8PpU7c','Tales of Arise — Hootle Drawing Song','🦉 Get doodling! Hootle\'s drawing song awaits! 🎶✏️ #HootleDrawingSong #TalesofArise\n\nFollow Bandai Namco Entertainment: \nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/bandainamcous\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/BandaiNamcoUS\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/BandaiNamcoUS\nTwitch: http://www.twitch.tv/bandainamcous','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KX3It8PpU7c/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KX3It8PpU7c/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KX3It8PpU7c/default.jpg','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UU_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UC_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw',6259,0,22,'2023-12-15 03:00:09.000000'),(9239,'EMZkmjE8wdw','JUJUTSU KAISEN CURSED CLASH – Gojo Satoru Teaches Game Mechanics','Satoru Gojo is here with a special lecture! Tag team enemies, utilize cursed energy, play with your friends online, and more in JUJUTSU KAISEN CURSED CLASH! Available February 2nd, 2024.\n\nPre-order today! https://www.bandainamcoent.com/games/jujutsu-kaisen-cursed-clash\n\n#jujutsukaisen #gojo','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EMZkmjE8wdw/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EMZkmjE8wdw/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EMZkmjE8wdw/default.jpg','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UU_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UC_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw',166059,0,456,'2023-12-14 14:30:05.000000'),(9240,'ToKJfywbe1o','TEKKEN 8 – Official Story Trailer','Witness true power. Experience the Mishima saga and fight fate in the TEKKEN 8 demo.\n\nPre-order #TEKKEN8 today: https://tekken.com/purchase','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ToKJfywbe1o/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ToKJfywbe1o/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ToKJfywbe1o/default.jpg','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UU_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw','Bandai Namco Entertain