_Qg/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3fljZyGz_Qg/default.jpg','Showa60','UUp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw','Showa60','UCp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw',67,0,0,'2023-12-21 07:25:38.000000'),(11323,'bPNmSouZKP8','Goku Subs in to Fight Broly [Showa Watches]','The footage in this video was used for criticism, commentary, and education and is protected by fair use law.\nCopyright Disclaimer under Section 107 of the copyright act 1976, allowance is made for fair use for purposes such as criticism, comment,news reporting, scholarship, and research. Fair use is a use permitted by copyright statute that might otherwise be infringing. Non-profit, educational, or personal use tips the balance in favor of fair use.\n\n\nHey Guys,\n\nLast time, Blank went in on Vegeta\'s side of the fight.  Super handles Goku\'s end and the laughs ensue.\nAfter this, the dynamic duo of hype tackle Gogeta vs Broly.\n\nDragon Ball is owned by Toei/Toei Animation, FujiTV, Toriyama Akira, Shueisha, and Funimation.\n\n\nCheck out the original video:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IoO8ofepEy0\n\nBlank Boy\'s Video:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2-e3h8Z2yiU\n\n\ncheckout my insta\nhttp://www.instagram.com/showa60\n\nSupport me on ko-fi\nhttps://ko-fi.com/showasama\n\n\n#DragonballSuper #Broly #codenamesuper','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bPNmSouZKP8/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bPNmSouZKP8/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bPNmSouZKP8/default.jpg','Showa60','UUp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw','Showa60','UCp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw',10,0,0,'2023-12-18 07:07:16.000000'),(11324,'-HzRpgmjC1I','YuYu Hakusho Comes to Life [Showa Watches]','Togashi Yosihiro\'s masterpiece is brought back to life in this live action reimagining of his story.\n14, I mean, 17 year-old Urameshi Yusuke uses his second chance to become a Spirit Dectective in order to stop evil paranormal activity that may destroy both worlds.\n\nMany changes were made and I have to say that in regards to episode 1, it\'s an ok start.\n\nA ton of editing was done for copyright and time.\n\nYuYu Hakusho is Property of Shueisha, FujiTV, TOHO, Pierrot, and Togashi Yoshihiro\n\n\nSubscribe and hit the bell icon for more cool content.\n\nhttp://www.instagram.com/showa60\n\nI do commission art too:\nhttp://artistree.io/request/showa60 \n\nYou can also donate to my Ko-fi:\nhttp://ko-fi.com/showasama \n\n\nYour support means a lot\n\n#yuyuhakusho #netflix  #liveaction','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-HzRpgmjC1I/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-HzRpgmjC1I/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-HzRpgmjC1I/default.jpg','Showa60','UUp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw','Showa60','UCp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw',25,0,0,'2023-12-16 00:33:54.000000'),(11325,'ulF_dIWDgW8','Are You Ready for Figuarts Makima? #chainsawman #bandai #shfiguarts #makima','','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ulF_dIWDgW8/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ulF_dIWDgW8/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ulF_dIWDgW8/default.jpg','Showa60','UUp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw','Showa60','UCp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw',146,0,1,'2023-12-13 04:24:11.000000'),(11326,'lM7YB-hviIc','it\'s coming #tokusatsu #supersentai #bandai','','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lM7YB-hviIc/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lM7YB-hviIc/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lM7YB-hviIc/default.jpg','Showa60','UUp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw','Showa60','UCp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw',8,0,0,'2023-12-12 17:44:54.000000'),(11327,'BDrfbqLQViI','That Throne was every Definition of dirty. #kingohger #tokusatsu #supersentai','','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BDrfbqLQViI/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BDrfbqLQViI/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BDrfbqLQViI/default.jpg','Showa60','UUp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw','Showa60','UCp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw',1129,0,1,'2023-12-11 17:25:21.000000'),(11328,'9cmwR6H5vs8','My Wife is a Rockstar!! Elphelt Returns in StrIVe','As part of the Season 3 line-up, Elphelt Valentine returns. This time sporting new skills and drip.  Oh and she\'s a Rockstar now!!\n\n\n\nWhat do you think?\n\nCommissions are open btw.\n \n\n http://instagram.com/showa60   \n\nSubscribe and hit the bell icon for more cool content.\n\nI do commission art too:\nhttp://artistree.io/request/showa60 \n\nYou can also donate to my Ko-fi:\nhttp://ko-fi.com/showasama \n\n\nYour support means a lot\n\n#guiltygearstrive #elpheltvalentine #videogameawards2023','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9cmwR6H5vs8/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9cmwR6H5vs8/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9cmwR6H5vs8/default.jpg','Showa60','UUp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw','Showa60','UCp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw',268,0,2,'2023-12-08 07:02:12.000000'),(11329,'6xxaKr6CaGw','Did We Need Another Goku Vs Superman Fight?','This was not meant to be informative and insightful. Just thought I would be American and express my feelings for once.\n\nSeriously, who the heck ask for this?  Thes second round murdered my expectations and made me numb this situation.  I\'m all for fan fights, but this is just ridiculously insane. I know Goku caught an L to Superman in this fight, and I\'m NOT watching it, and you can\'t make me.\n\nI like Dragon Ball and Superman, but I am absolutely tired of how this particular fan fight has gone off the rails. Furthermore, I\'m just tired of people using Goku or Vegeta, or any other DB character as a measuring stick for other powerful characters in fiction.\n\n\nWhat do you think?\n\nCommissions are open btw.\nhttp://instagram.com/showa60 \n\nSubscribe and hit the bell icon for more cool content.\n\nI do commission art too:\nhttp://artistree.io/request/showa60 \n\nYou can also donate to my Ko-fi:\nhttp://ko-fi.com/showasama \n\n\nYour support means a lot\n\n\n#dragonball #DCcomics #gokuvssuperman','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6xxaKr6CaGw/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6xxaKr6CaGw/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6xxaKr6CaGw/default.jpg','Showa60','UUp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw','Showa60','UCp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw',16,0,1,'2023-12-07 00:03:10.000000'),(11330,'NoFtQgO_vmg','The Tough as Nails Sorceror, Nobara [Showa Draws]','This fan art thing is challenging, but cool.\n\nToday, I pay my respect to one of Jujutsu Kaisen\'s leading ladies, Kugisaki Nobara.  Admittedly, she\'s not my favorite character in fiction, but a character worth the respect she gets from her fans.  She\'s blunt, straightforward, and a mood maker.  If she thinks you\'re awesome or straight garbage, she\'ll let you know on sight.\n\nJutusu Kaisen[呪術廻戦/Sorcery Fight] is a manga series by Akutami Gege[芥見下々] that released in Weekly Shounen Jump in 2018.  An anime adaptation released in 2020 by Mappa [GARO: Divine Flame, Chainsaw Man, Attack on Titan].  It follows Itadori Yuuji and his adventures as a skilled sorceror for the Tokyo Sorceror school.  His already enhanced physiology, peppered by his body being a host for a psychotic Curse, named Sukuna, becomes one of the key points in his journey into adapting into a society where cursed spirits, yokai, and other supernatural occurences are commonplace.\n\nOh yeah, there\'s a lot of jumping people in this series.... lots and lots of JUMPING!!\n\n\nCommissions are open btw.\ninstagram: @showa60 \n\nSubscribe and hit the bell icon for more cool content.\n\nI do commission art to:\nhttp://artistree.io/request/showa60 \n\nYou can also donate to my Ko-fi:\nhttp://ko-fi.com/showasama \n\n\nYour support means a lot\n\n#jujutsukaisen #anime #nobara #anime #manga','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NoFtQgO_vmg/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NoFtQgO_vmg/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NoFtQgO_vmg/default.jpg','Showa60','UUp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw','Showa60','UCp59mUL6VMTGbalxLTAVzbw',138,0,0,'2023-12-03 07:19:50.000000'),(11331,'O49_Zbjy104','【TEKKEN7】悪あがきランクマ配信','メンバーシップ登録はこちらから!!\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrVYroViI7W0PxBEoSDfR3A/join\n\n干し芋のリスト\nhttps://www.amazon.jp/hz/wishlist/ls/2QAQ5JWI2TJ7D?ref_=wl_share\n\nTEKKEN7,ranked match,Kazuya Mishima,PEWGF\n\nチャンネルメンバーシップ\n【TNG紳士録】\n\n─伯爵─\n■たけるん自己満TV様\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8fkwnvUstGW-CL5kj19jLw\n■りょちゃん