ture. Tasty Steve was able to experience the city through Vue Orleans, an interactive exhibit and observatory, prior to the finals.\n\nJoin us in New Orleans for the #TWT2023 Global Finals, January 12-14, 2024, as well as on twitch.tv/TEKKEN!','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GPIQhpBG1L0/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GPIQhpBG1L0/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GPIQhpBG1L0/default.jpg','Bandai Namco Esports','UUKHx_yf3dI2ajWAjXRJ_9Rw','Bandai Namco Esports','UCKHx_yf3dI2ajWAjXRJ_9Rw',1188,0,11,'2024-01-05 18:00:11.000000'),(11752,'vJuUXw8gP0k','TWT2023 Global Finals Visits Piccola Gelateria','If you happen to have a sweet tooth while in New Orleans for the #TWT2023 Global Finals, there are plenty of places to satisfy that craving.\n\nSumichu stopped by a locally owned and operated shop to learn the ins and outs of Gelato at Piccola Gelateria!\n\nJoin us in New Orleans for the #TWT2023 Global Finals, January 12-14, 2024, as well as on http://twitch.tv/TEKKEN!','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vJuUXw8gP0k/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vJuUXw8gP0k/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vJuUXw8gP0k/default.jpg','Bandai Namco Esports','UUKHx_yf3dI2ajWAjXRJ_9Rw','Bandai Namco Esports','UCKHx_yf3dI2ajWAjXRJ_9Rw',1385,0,12,'2024-01-02 18:00:31.000000'),(11753,'21kFXnx2vQ0','TWT2023 Global Finals Ride St. Charles Streetcar','One of the most classic ways to explore the #TWT2023 Global Finals\' city, New Orleans, is by streetcar. \n\nJoin Tasty Steve and Majin Obama as they catch a ride on the St. Charles Streetcar and get a quick look at the city!\n\nJoin us in New Orleans for the #TWT2023 Global Finals, January 12-14, 2024, as well as on twitch.tv/TEKKEN!','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/21kFXnx2vQ0/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/21kFXnx2vQ0/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/21kFXnx2vQ0/default.jpg','Bandai Namco Esports','UUKHx_yf3dI2ajWAjXRJ_9Rw','Bandai Namco Esports','UCKHx_yf3dI2ajWAjXRJ_9Rw',1611,0,16,'2023-12-30 18:00:00.000000'),(11754,'feyN8ZeI-fY','TWT2023 Global Finals Visits Parkway Bakery','New Orleans, the location of the #TWT2023 Global Finals, is famous for its Po\'Boys. \n\nCheck out Majin Obama\'s journey to a local favorite to give some of their food a try!\n\nJoin us in New Orleans for the #TWT2023 Global Finals, January 12-14, 2024, as well as on twitch.tv/TEKKEN!','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/feyN8ZeI-fY/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/feyN8ZeI-fY/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/feyN8ZeI-fY/default.jpg','Bandai Namco Esports','UUKHx_yf3dI2ajWAjXRJ_9Rw','Bandai Namco Esports','UCKHx_yf3dI2ajWAjXRJ_9Rw',2053,0,29,'2023-12-30 00:30:22.000000'),(11755,'TFSnw9EB9KM','European TEKKEN Cup DAY 2 TOP 8','','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TFSnw9EB9KM/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TFSnw9EB9KM/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TFSnw9EB9KM/default.jpg','Bandai Namco Esports','UUKHx_yf3dI2ajWAjXRJ_9Rw','Bandai Namco Esports','UCKHx_yf3dI2ajWAjXRJ_9Rw',36491,0,35,'2023-12-17 14:41:28.000000'),(11756,'By5r2UvKDUA','【エルデン】エルデンリング買ったんですけどレナラの取り巻きが怖いです　～その7～','噛むんじゃない！\n\n※右上はマスコットの熾火だんろちゃんです\n　ふよふよ動きます\n※twitterです　Xじゃねーか！\n　https://twitter.com/danro_v','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/By5r2UvKDUA/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/By5r2UvKDUA/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/By5r2UvKDUA/default.jpg','danro','UUw1wljwpuzVfaZk65aBsWRw','danro','UCw1wljwpuzVfaZk65aBsWRw',97,0,0,'2024-01-07 12:18:33.000000'),(11757,'tlfFro8aemY','【エルデン】エルデンリング買ったんですけど輝石鍵はどこだい？　～その6-2～','このシャブリリのブドウは出来損ないだ、食べられないよ。\n\n※右上はマスコットの熾火だんろちゃんです\n　ふよふよ動きます\n※twitterです　Xじゃねーか！\n　https://twitter.com/danro_v','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tlfFro8aemY/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tlfFro8aemY/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tlfFro8aemY/default.jpg','danro','UUw1wljwpuzVfaZk65aBsWRw','danro','UCw1wljwpuzVfaZk65aBsWRw',43,0,3,'2024-01-06 18:45:00.000000'),(11758,'v-jThc7oR_s','【エルデン】エルデンリング買ったんですけどブドウ狩りに行こうぜ！　～その6～','このぶどう一粒\n\n※右上はマスコットの熾火だんろちゃんです\n　ふよふよ動きます\n※twitterです　Xじゃねーか！\n　https://twitter.com/danro_v','https://i.ytimg.com