me GX-650 - Powersupply humming','After almost 9 Years, the the time was right to buy a new PC. So, I bought a new, prebuild PC from alternate.de a few days ago. The model i choose was the \"Golem Highend 8Core\" PC. As PSU, it´s using the Seasonic Prime GX-650. However after the first awesome and smooth FPS Amount in Apex, i recognized a reoccuring, humming noise coming from the PSU. When i press the \"Hybrid Mode\", it seems to disappear, yet im unsure if this button has some negative impact on the life durability over the long term.','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/clZLix-HFSc/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/clZLix-HFSc/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/clZLix-HFSc/default.jpg','Game Master','UUUBwBaG4bolHNRR_WUB-9xA','Game Master','UCUBwBaG4bolHNRR_WUB-9xA',611,0,4,'2020-07-02 05:40:59.000000'),(13474,'hRFrbmAX7no','[原神] 叡智な千織も良いが、本命は綾華','','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hRFrbmAX7no/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hRFrbmAX7no/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hRFrbmAX7no/default.jpg','まいけるみにける','UUDYIuNZUNUD39kyP0hkevWQ','まいけるみにける','UCDYIuNZUNUD39kyP0hkevWQ',508,0,0,'2023-12-29 00:25:20.000000'),(13475,'VCWgpEbxU5g','[原神] ナヴィア ドラゴンストライク','ナヴィアかわよい😊','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VCWgpEbxU5g/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VCWgpEbxU5g/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VCWgpEbxU5g/default.jpg','まいけるみにける','UUDYIuNZUNUD39kyP0hkevWQ','まいけるみにける','UCDYIuNZUNUD39kyP0hkevWQ',1423,0,3,'2023-12-20 11:07:27.000000'),(13476,'IngSWSwN4Ws','[鉄拳8]  体 験 版 !','','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IngSWSwN4Ws/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IngSWSwN4Ws/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IngSWSwN4Ws/default.jpg','まいけるみにける','UUDYIuNZUNUD39kyP0hkevWQ','まいけるみにける','UCDYIuNZUNUD39kyP0hkevWQ',55,0,0,'2023-12-15 10:28:57.000000'),(13477,'61tRS7to-SI','[原神] 新しい神アイテムを使って雷電将軍撮影会','','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/61tRS7to-SI/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/61tRS7to-SI/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/61tRS7to-SI/default.jpg','まいけるみにける','UUDYIuNZUNUD39kyP0hkevWQ','まいけるみにけ