をひたすら遊んでいるので、その対戦動画の一部をアップ。\nAIがコンボミスすると、なぜかこっちが恥ずかしくなりますｗ','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/eov-bLHKeII/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/eov-bLHKeII/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/eov-bLHKeII/default.jpg','ともろ。','UUl6rE6Dn1S_WCjbGOiXLfMQ','ともろ。','UCl6rE6Dn1S_WCjbGOiXLfMQ',59,0,0,'2023-12-23 15:01:36.000000'),(13536,'S1uf-ACM3B0','【SF6 ガイル戦】ランクマ対戦動画②','自己満動画ガイル戦②','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/S1uf-ACM3B0/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/S1uf-ACM3B0/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/S1uf-ACM3B0/default.jpg','ともろ。','UUl6rE6Dn1S_WCjbGOiXLfMQ','ともろ。','UCl6rE6Dn1S_WCjbGOiXLfMQ',2,0,0,'2023-12-09 15:28:03.000000'),(13537,'Yp_fyQxSXH4','【SF6 ガイル戦】ランクマ対戦動画','ランクマのガイル戦のリプレイ動画。普段実況はOFFだけど、リプレイ戦はアールさんの実況入れると何か燃えるんで有りで見てます。','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Yp_fyQxSXH4/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Yp_fyQxSXH4/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Yp_fyQxSXH4/default.jpg','ともろ。','UUl6rE6Dn1S_WCjbGOiXLfMQ','ともろ。','UCl6rE6Dn1S_WCjbGOiXLfMQ',10,0,0,'2023-08-27 14:29:55.000000'),(13538,'RcW60sq4yDY','【SF6 DJ】ランクマ対戦動画','','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/RcW60sq4yDY/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/RcW60sq4yDY/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/RcW60sq4yDY/default.jpg','ともろ。','UUl6rE6Dn1S_WCjbGOiXLfMQ','ともろ。','UCl6rE6Dn1S_WCjbGOiXLfMQ',3,0,0,'2023-07-17 15:54:39.000000'),(13539,'SBgjfaDSkZY','【SF6OB】カジュアルマッチ：ガイル戦','カジュアルマッチで遭遇したガイル戦動画。','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SBgjfaDSkZY/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SBgjfaDSkZY/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SBgjfaDSkZY/default.jpg','ともろ。','UUl6rE6Dn1S_WCjbGOiXLfMQ','ともろ。','UCl6rE6Dn1S_WCjbGOiXLfMQ',17,0,0,'2023-05-27 15:05:13.000000'),(13540,'GgJVkqsDeNc','Tekken 8 (鉄拳8) - DEMO STORY MODE GAMEPLAY PLAYSTATION 5 (4K)','#tekken8  #playstation  #bandainamco #ps5 \n\n🌟 Join the Path to 1,000 Subscribes \n\nLIKE 👍 COMMENT 💬 & \n╔═╦╗╔╦╗╔═╦═╦╦╦╦╗╔═╗\n║╚╣║║║╚╣╚╣╔╣╔╣║╚╣═╣\n╠╗║╚╝║║╠╗║╚╣║║║║║═╣\n╚═╩══╩═╩═╩═╩╝╚╩═╩═╝!!! 🔔\n\nTekken 8 (鉄拳8) is an upcoming fighting game co-developed by Bandai Namco Studios and Arika and published by Bandai Namco Entertainment.[1] The eighth main and tenth overall installment in the Tekken series, the game is set to be released on January 26, 2024 for PlayStation 5, Windows, and Xbox Series X/S.\n\nAccording to director Katsuhiro Harada, Tekken 8 gameplay will focus on \"aggressiveness\" and will have a new \"Heat\" gauge system, in addition to returning gameplay features from Tekken 7, such as Rage system-based attacks, with the Rage Drive having been separated and reworked as a Heat system-based move known as Heat Smash, leaving the Rage State that can only have an access to use Rage Art once more like prior to the Fated Retribution version of Tekken 7. The gameplay will reward aggressiveness rather than defensive or patient play. The Heat State grants not only chip damage and additional move sets, but also changes the properties of some characters’ move sets, such as a heavy guard break. Fighters can also dash cancel their designate moves into the Heat State. The Heat State’s timer can be stopped if fighters’ move sets are being used.[1] When guarding against a normal state’s heavy attack, or Heat State characters, fighters will receive a chip damage that causes their health bar to become regenerable. However, unlike the Tag mode-only health bar regeneration system from Tekken Tag Tournament games, fighters’ recoverable health can only be recovered by attacking the opponent.[1]\n\nTekken 7’s “Screw” damage property was originally going to return in this game, but it is ultimately replaced with a newer juggle combo extender system that puts opponent into a ground-bound-like state upon falling backflip to the ground quickly - similar to Tekken 6 - whether the combo extender be a launcher or a knockback.\n\nThe game will provide a more cinematic fighting environment. For instance, there will be a focus on stage destruction, and character reactions to these.[2] Rather than recycling content, all character models are completely new and are meant to be an improvement over previous games. In addition, voice lines will be based solely on the current voice actors, rather than using any from the previous games. In contrast to Tekken 7, which is powered by Unreal Engine 4, Tekken 8 will be powered by the Unreal Engine 5, making it the very first major fighting game to utilize this latest game engine.\n\nThe online mode for this game is now an avatar-based battle hub lobby known as \"Arcade Quest\", which covers arcade environments, regular online and tournament matches, customizing Avatar\'s appearances, and will use Fight Money system.[3]','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GgJVkqsDeNc/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GgJVkqsDeNc/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GgJVkqsDeNc/default.jpg','niZGaming','UU-Utpe1_tET_QXhWyCcOk2w','niZGaming','UC-Utpe1_tET_QXhWyCcOk2w',35,0,2,'2023-12-14 16:16:22.000000'),(13541,'mWJ_dd68ato','I \"CONDUIT\"🌟','#apexlegends #ps5 #gaming #chillmusic #chill \n\n🌟 Join the Path to 1,000 Subscribes \n\nLIKE 👍 COMMENT 💬 & \n╔═╦╗╔╦╗╔═╦═╦╦╦╦╗╔═╗\n║╚╣║║║╚╣╚╣╔╣╔╣║╚╣═╣\n╠╗║╚╝║║╠╗║╚╣║║║║║═╣\n╚═╩══╩═╩═╩═╩╝╚╩═╩═╝!!! 🔔\n\nBackground Music : https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QO2R95bWdeo\n\n🔊 Artist: Willpower · l\'Outlander\n\n℗ 2023 Lofi Records\n\nReleased on: 2022-02-20\n\nProducer: Dan Chicheportiche\nMusic  Publisher: Copyright Control\nComposer  Lyricist: Dan Chicheportiche\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n🔴Social Media🔴\n     FB Page : https://www.facebook.com/niZGMNG\n\nApex Legends is a free-to-play battle royale-hero shooter game developed by Respawn Entertainment and published by Electronic Arts. It was released for PlayStation 4, Windows, and Xbox One in February 2019, for Nintendo Switch in March 2021, and for PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X/S in March 2022. A mobile version of the game designed for touchscreens titled Apex Legends Mobile was released in May 2022 on Android and iOS. The game supports cross-platform play, excluding the aforementioned mobile platforms.\n\nBefore the match, players form into two- or three-player squads, and select from pre-designed characters with distinctive abilities, known as \"Legends\". The game has two gameplay modes. In \"Battle Royale\", up to 20 three-person squads or 30 two-person duos land on an island and search for weapons and supplies before attempting to defeat all other players in combat. The available play area on the island shrinks over time, forcing players to keep moving or else find themselves outside the play area which can be fatal. The final team alive wins the round. In \"Arenas\", players form into three-player squads and fight against another squad in a 3v3 team deathmatch over a series of rounds to determine the winner of the match. Teams win when their team has at least 3 points and is 2 points ahead.\n\nApex Legends is set in the same science fiction universe as Respawn Entertainment\'s Titanfall series, with several characters from the Titanfall series appearing either as minor characters or playable Legends. Work on the game began around late 2016, though the project remained a secret right up until its launch. The game\'s release in 2019 came as a surprise, as until that point it had been assumed that Respawn Entertainment was working on a third installment to the Titanfall franchise, the studio\'s previous major game. Apex Legends received generally positive reviews from critics, who praised its gameplay, progression system, and fusion of elements from various genres. Some considered it a worthy competitor to other battle royale games. Apex Legends surpassed 25 million players by the end of its first week, and 50 million within its first month. By April 2021, it had approximately 100 million players making it one of the most played video games of all time by player count.','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mWJ_dd68ato/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mWJ_dd68ato/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mWJ_dd68ato/default.jpg','niZGaming','UU-Utpe1_tET_QXhWyCcOk2w','niZGaming','UC-Utpe1_tET_QXhWyCcOk2w',15,0,1,'2023-12-13 22:08:33.000000'),(13542,'t3pYDVbMgoE','\"CHAMPION\"','#apexlegends #ps5 #gaming #chillmusic #chill \n\nBackground Music : \n\nChill Piano Electronic Music (For Videos) - \"Home\" by Neutrin05 🇺🇸\n\n🔊 Artist: Neutrin05 https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xneiaE_SCg8&list=PLfP6i5T0-DkLrBQvVfxeL-zGZdBvQ5Jm5\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nMelodic Lofi Chill (Music For Videos) - \"Alone\" by Alex Productions 🇮🇹\n\n🔊 Artist: Alex Productions https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-jrh3Mk8ZCA&list=PLfP6i5T0-DkLrBQvVfxeL-zGZdBvQ5Jm5&index=2\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nLike , Subscribe and tap that 🔔 to get notified when i post a latest video!\n\n🔴Social Media🔴\n     FB Page : https://www.facebook.com/niZGMNG\n\nApex Legends is a free-to-play battle royale-hero shooter game developed by Respawn Entertainment and published by Electronic Arts. It was released for PlayStation 4, Windows, and Xbox One in February 2019, for Nintendo Switch in March 2021, and for PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X/S in March 2022. A mobile version of the game designed for touchscreens titled Apex Legends Mobile was released in May 2022 on Android and iOS. The game supports cross-platform play, excluding the aforementioned mobile platforms.\n\nBefore the match, players form into two- or three-player squads, and select from pre-designed characters with distinctive abilities, known as \"Legends\". The game has two gameplay modes. In \"Battle Royale\", up to 20 three-person squads or 30 two-person duos land on an island and search for weapons and supplies before attempting to defeat all other players in combat. The available play area on the island shrinks over time, forcing players to keep moving or else find themselves outside the play area which can be fatal. The final team alive wins the round. In \"Arenas\", players form into three-player squads and fight against another squad in a 3v3 team deathmatch over a series of rounds to determine the winner of the match. Teams win when their team has at least 3 points and is 2 points ahead.\n\nApex Legends is set in the same science fiction universe as Respawn Entertainment\'s Titanfall series, with several characters from the Titanfall series appearing either as minor characters or playable Legends. Work on the game began around late 2016, though the project remained a secret right up until its launch. The game\'s release in 2019 came as a surprise, as until that point it had been assumed that Respawn Entertainment was working on a third installment to the Titanfall franchise, the studio\'s previous major game. Apex Legends received generally positive reviews from critics, who praised its gameplay, progression system, and fusion of elements from various genres. Some considered it a worthy competitor to other battle royale games. Apex Legends surpassed 25 million players by the end of its first week, and 50 million within its first month. By April 2021, it had approximately 100 million players making it one of the most played video games of all time by player count.','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/t3pYDVbMgoE/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/t3pYDVbMgoE/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/t3pYDVbMgoE/default.jpg','niZGaming','UU-Utpe1_tET_QXhWyCcOk2w','niZGaming','UC-Utpe1_tET_QXhWyCcOk2w',30,0,1,'2023-10-28 20:50:56.000000'),(13543,'fhUA17QCZIw','CATAYLST \"Winning takes iron will. I brought iron and will.\"','#apexlegends #ps5 #gaming \n\nLike , Subscribe and tap that 🔔 to get notified when i post a latest video!\n🔴Social Media🔴\n     FB Page : https://www.facebook.com/niZGMNG\n\nApex Legends is a free-to-play battle royale-hero shooter game developed by Respawn Entertainment and published by Electronic Arts. It was released for PlayStation 4, Windows, and 