https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Uz-ef9zO2uk/default_live.jpg','tekkenchannel','UU6y98o30kK3yaVwTF-CmH7g','tekkenchannel','UC6y98o30kK3yaVwTF-CmH7g',0,0,0,'2024-01-08 02:00:44.000000'),(16162,'zl3NDSWDW-Y','【TAKE 鉄拳７配信】Heihachi Rank Match Tekken7','#ユウ #ノビ #タケ\n格闘ゲーム「鉄拳7」のプロチームTeamYAMASAのチャンネルです。\n\n▼チームメンバー\nユウ　https://twitter.com/Yuu_Norespect\nノビ　https://twitter.com/daichinobi\nタケ　https://twitter.com/hk_takkun\n\n▼スポンサー\n山佐ネクスト株式会社　https://yamasa-next.co.jp/\nContieaks　https://www.sekikagu.co.jp/contieaks/\nCORSAIR　https://www.corsair.com/ja/ja/\nGALLERIA　https://www.dospara.co.jp/5gamepc/\n親指でんき　https://oya-ub.com/\n\n▼各スポンサー様 提供機材一覧\nhttps://www.geartics.com/team_YAMASA\n\n▼関連チャンネル\n【nobitube】https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCof1UwAzZ7gQSuWkyqh3OGw\n【TeamYAMASA Twitch】https://www.twitch.tv/teamyamasa_tekken\n\n▼チームへの質問、雑談はコチラ\nhttps://marshmallow-qa.com/messages','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zl3NDSWDW-Y/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zl3NDSWDW-Y/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zl3NDSWDW-Y/default.jpg','【鉄拳】TeamYAMASA','UUICMbIe_1gc_F0y9Bt9QuZw','【鉄拳】TeamYAMASA','UCICMbIe_1gc_F0y9Bt9QuZw',653,0,0,'2024-01-10 04:13:58.000000'),(16163,'J71GKJRl5f0','ONE PIECE: PIRATE WARRIORS 4 – One Piece Film: Red Pack – DLC Character Pack 5 Trailer','With my singing… I can bring happiness to everyone in the world! One Piece Film: Red Pack – featuring Uta, Shanks, and Koby – is available now in ONE PIECE: PIRATE WARRIORS 4!\n\nOne Piece Film: Red Anime Song Pack is also available now – battle to the sounds of Uta’s unforgettable songs!\n\nPick it up today as part of ONE PIECE: PIRATE WARRIORS 4 — Character Pass 2: https://www.bandainamcoent.com/games/one-piece-pirate-warriors-4 \n\nCharacter Pass 2 also comes with a bonus Onigashima Battle costume for Trafalgar Law!\n\n#OPPW4 #ONEPIECE\nFollow One Piece Games: https://twitter.com/onepiece_games\n\nFollow Bandai Namco Entertainment America:\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/bandainamcous\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/Ba