:00:17.000000'),(16166,'wRIOVeirAa0','TEKKEN 8 – “Story So Far\" with Brian Cox','The Mishima saga rages on in #TEKKEN8. But how did we get here? Brian Cox recounts the tournaments, twists, and cliffside encounters that make TEKKEN, TEKKEN.\n\nPre-order TEKKEN 8: https://tekken.com/purchase\n\nFollow TEKKEN:\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/TEKKEN\nTwitter: https://www.twitter.com/TEKKEN\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/TEKKENAmericas\nTikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@TEKKEN\n\nFollow Bandai Namco US\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/bandainamcous\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/BandaiNamcoUS\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/BandaiNamcoUS\nTwitch: http://www.twitch.tv/bandainamcous','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wRIOVeirAa0/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wRIOVeirAa0/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wRIOVeirAa0/default.jpg','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UU_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UC_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw',617017,0,3151,'2024-01-09 14:00:41.000000'),(16167,'Vq4SX2EVm64','It\'s gonna be a crazy ride in SAND LAND - several of them, in fact!','Check out all the vehicles we\'ve revealed so far that you can find in the game! #SandLand #AkiraToriyama','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Vq4SX2EVm64/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Vq4SX2EVm64/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Vq4SX2EVm64/default.jpg','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UU_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw','Bandai Namco Entertainment America','UC_ntXHv-XdKCD7CPynVvnQw',3511,0,15,'2024-01-08 17:00:40.000000'),(16168,'7NbIs4VVZes','新作格ゲー鉄拳8のファランを紹介します','コメントする前にお読みください\n・誹謗中傷はご遠慮ください（対戦相手含む）\n・～してくれ等の要望もお控えください\n・喧嘩は両方非表示にします\n\n▼スポンサー\n山佐ネクスト株式会社　https://yamasa-next.co.jp/\nContieaks　https://www.sekikagu.co.jp/contieaks/\nCORSAIR　https://www.corsair.com/ja/ja/\nGALLERIA　https://www.dospara.co.jp/5gamepc/\n親指でんき　https://oya-ub.com/\n\n▼チームメンバー\nユウ　https://twitter.com/Yuu_Norespect\nノビ　https://twitter.com/daichinobi\nタケ　https://twitter.com/hk_takkun\n\n▼各スポ