','UU354dQz5F1ME5w5ZzphfXEg','よつみん屋','UC354dQz5F1ME5w5ZzphfXEg',41,0,0,'2024-01-09 22:19:36.000000'),(16250,'C7WBpyo-vxY','EMILIA\'S LOSING (IN SWIMSUIT) MATCHES IN TEKKEN 7 FOR 30 MINS - KATARINA VS KATARINA REMATCH','You can request a video at\ndiscord dot gg slash t8PfYzXG9W\n\n#tekken6 #tekken7 #tekken8','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/C7WBpyo-vxY/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/C7WBpyo-vxY/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/C7WBpyo-vxY/default.jpg','Emilia plays Tekken 8','UUMEWQCAXhphT3DJm-X80lCg','Emilia plays Tekken 8','UCMEWQCAXhphT3DJm-X80lCg',30,0,0,'2024-01-09 19:18:20.000000'),(16251,'_linJU-xJCQ','EMILIA\'S LOSING MATCHES IN TEKKEN 7 FOR 30 MINS - KATARINA MIRROR MATCHES','You can request a video at\ndiscord dot gg slash t8PfYzXG9W\n\n#tekken6 #tekken7 #tekken8','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_linJU-xJCQ/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_linJU-xJCQ/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_linJU-xJCQ/default.jpg','Emilia plays Tekken 8','UUMEWQCAXhphT3DJm-X80lCg','Emilia plays Tekken 8','UCMEWQCAXhphT3DJm-X80lCg',24,0,0,'2024-01-08 11:46:15.000000'),(16252,'HimiH8OnutU','20240108[鉄拳7]気合いの2週間','','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HimiH8OnutU/hqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HimiH8OnutU/mqdefault.jpg','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HimiH8OnutU/default.jpg','maisuke','UU11H5IHi5YpHjizHuJgopWg','maisuke','UC11H5IHi5YpHjizHuJgopWg',219,0,0,'2024-01-08 11:57:49.000000'),(16253,'KIkodU_rxO0','【Tekken7】Lee Chaolang【Leverless】','👇信じられんレベルで過去一再生数伸びてない悲劇の自信作\n【ホラー実況】中国武術家による「夜間警備」\n【前編】\nhttps://youtu.be/MdZRMe-hZcQ\n【後編】\nhttps://youtu.be/76fVdv1VMmc\n ↑特に【後編】がおすすめです(´；ω；｀)ｳｯ…\n\n【鉄拳8】チャオラン新スライディング実演動画\nhttps://youtube.com/shorts/YYfEVd19gbA?feature=share\n\n【鉄拳8】中国武術家による「レオ」モーションテイスティング【八極拳】\nhttps://youtube.com/live/tGkKCE89ooo\nソムリエ本人による八極拳実演動画\nhttps://youtube.com/shorts/I99krZxICzE?feature=share\n\n【鉄拳8】中国武術家による「麗奈」モーションテイスティング【躰道×平八×釘崎野薔薇】2023/11/14生配信\nhttps://youtube.com/live/6mbuwwhkJto?feature=share\n\n【鉄拳8】中国武術家による「ヴィクター」モーションテイスティング【辛口】2023/11/04生配信\nhttps://yo